{"displayStem":"극성 신장세포 배양계에서 기질 S의 혈액 쪽 유입을 평가했다. 세포 수·유리 농도·온도는 동일하고 X는 세포 생존성에 영향을 주지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C09 c09-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c09-graph\"><figure class=\"c09-panel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"S 농도 (mg/L)에 따른 초기 유입 (nmol/min)\"><style>text{font:17px 'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif}</style><text x=\"15\" y=\"24\">초기 유입 (nmol/min)</text><path d=\"M65 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"56\">대조</text><path d=\"M190 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></path><text x=\"215\" y=\"56\">X</text><path d=\"M66 78V263H431\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path d=\"M66 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M248.5 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"248.5\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12.0</text><path d=\"M431 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"431\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24</text><path d=\"M61 263h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M61 170.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"175.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">8</text><path d=\"M61 78h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"end\">16</text><polyline points=\"66,263 81.20833333333333,226 111.625,186.6875 157.25,156.625 248.5,124.25 431,84.12812499999998\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"263\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"81.20833333333333\" cy=\"226\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"111.625\" cy=\"186.6875\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"157.25\" cy=\"156.625\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"248.5\" cy=\"124.25\" r=\"2.5